    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602040/extras/14fe4eb5b4844df2d3c3e6d232a900b4.avif?t=1744305406\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to The Life Together Online \u2013 a life simulation game!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Living World Filled with Players</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Life Together Online</strong> is a reimagining and evolution of past project ideas, brought to life as an online world where players from all over the globe can connect, make new friends, enjoy their time or develop their characters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A World Where Every Character Is a Real Person</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every character you see* is a real player behind the screen, with their own unpredictability, mysteries and goals. You\u2019ll meet unique individuals you may never encounter again, making every interaction special.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602040/extras/ea1b3e4bed7f6c02a7f352ef19a7b609.poster.avif?t=1744305406\" width=600 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602040/extras/ea1b3e4bed7f6c02a7f352ef19a7b609.webm?t=1744305406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602040/extras/ea1b3e4bed7f6c02a7f352ef19a7b609.mp4?t=1744305406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create Your Unique Character</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your one of a kind character with a flexible appearance editor. Express yourself through clothing, hairstyles, tattoos or makeup. Bring your individuality to life and immerse yourself in this vibrant world!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Home Is Where You Choose</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can create your own server, join an existing one or freely travel between worlds built by other players. As a resident of a server, you\u2019ll have the opportunity to purchase a unique home that no one else can own, becoming part of a local community, making neighbors, and welcoming guests. If you prefer freedom, you can stay in hotels without being tied to a specific residence - perfect for travelers or those not ready to invest in real estate. Everything depends on your preferences - no restrictions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602040/extras/b6ea9b0745508622454362078abb9257.poster.avif?t=1744305406\" width=600 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602040/extras/b6ea9b0745508622454362078abb9257.webm?t=1744305406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602040/extras/b6ea9b0745508622454362078abb9257.mp4?t=1744305406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize and Furnish Your Home</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers extensive customization options for your home. The city features various stores where you can purchase furniture, lighting, surface materials and electronics. You can transport your purchases yourself or load them into your car, then arrange everything in your home in real time with no limitations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602040/extras/0d73435813667f938fb30b801e814243.poster.avif?t=1744305406\" width=600 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602040/extras/0d73435813667f938fb30b801e814243.webm?t=1744305406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602040/extras/0d73435813667f938fb30b801e814243.mp4?t=1744305406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose Your Career and Lifestyle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your own path in life. You can get a job, become part of a community and provide services to other players - whether as a bartender in a local venue, a sales manager in a store or a barista at a caf\u00e9. If you value freedom, you can work as a delivery driver, completing orders whenever you want. Advance in your chosen field, earn bonuses and invest in greater profits. Or, if you prefer, do nothing at all - this world lets you choose your own way to live.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602040/extras/480e5f4f357020c8a936e53580561cd9.poster.avif?t=1744305406\" width=600 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602040/extras/480e5f4f357020c8a936e53580561cd9.webm?t=1744305406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602040/extras/480e5f4f357020c8a936e53580561cd9.mp4?t=1744305406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Social Life - The Key to New Connections</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Social life in <strong>The Life Together Online</strong> is diverse. You can visit parks, caf\u00e9s, bars, nightclubs and other locations where you\u2019ll always have a chance to meet interesting people. New connections happen spontaneously - during a city walk, at a social venue or even at work, where a casual conversation with a customer could lead to something unexpected. Host a house party or attend one by invitation - it\u2019s all up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602040/extras/82892d91eed2b0d181c2ed2e92e53b88.poster.avif?t=1744305406\" width=600 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602040/extras/82892d91eed2b0d181c2ed2e92e53b88.webm?t=1744305406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602040/extras/82892d91eed2b0d181c2ed2e92e53b88.mp4?t=1744305406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Communication and Interaction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact not only through voice chat but also via an intuitive in-game interface that allows you to send messages, exchange gifts and items and perform various shared activities. Build friendships, form romantic relationships and even become roommates with another player to share a home together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Unique Experience Awaits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Life Together Online</strong> offers a one-of-a-kind experience, aiming to become a recognizable and beloved brand among players, as well as the first fully developed online life simulation game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602040/extras/483e997f7676227777a6f0b89e4b23ec.poster.avif?t=1744305406\" width=600 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602040/extras/483e997f7676227777a6f0b89e4b23ec.webm?t=1744305406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602040/extras/483e997f7676227777a6f0b89e4b23ec.mp4?t=1744305406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602040/extras/85aa0df8d543f68b1fbe7c491d646a59.avif?t=1744305406\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*Excluding NPCs that provide various services</i></p>",
